    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Christmas Journey to Santa is a relaxing platformer game about a snowman who dreams of meeting Santa Claus on Christmas Eve. He sets off on a long journey to fulfill his wish. Traveling around the world, he collects magic red coins as a gift for Santa. <br>On his way, he meets many obstacles, so you need to be careful and agile to avoid them. <br>You will enjoy colorful graphics and beautiful music that will create a truly festive mood. <br>A magical atmosphere and positive emotions await both children and adults in the game. <br>Are you ready to help the snowman fulfill his dream?</p>",
